### Step 4: Feed Back Into Scanners

When patterns.json has 5+ deals:
- Scanner priority adjustments: if BROKER wins 3x more than ARBITRAGE → increase money-flow-scanner weight for broker-type bottlenecks
- Channel preferences: if LinkedIn reply rate < 10% but email > 40% → deal-tracker generates email-first cards
- Price calibration: if deals consistently close at 60% of initial ask → adjust margin calculations
- Industry focus: if one industry has 2x win rate → scanners prioritize that industry's flows
- Contact targeting: if Operations Managers respond 3x more than CTOs → deal cards target Ops Managers

## Commands

- `/hunt deals learn <card_id>` — Extract patterns from single deal
- `/hunt deals patterns` — Display current pattern store with confidence levels
- `/hunt deals insights` — Top 5 actionable insights from all deal data

